:''Not to be confused with [[Princess Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Princess Cat]].''
'''Possessed Empress''' (操られしネコ女王, ''Ayatsura Reshi Neko Joō'', "'''Possessed Cat Queen'''") is [[Princess Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Empress Cat]], possessed by an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] as a product of her [[Empress' Research|Research]]. She first appears in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Temptation's Symphony]]. She was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Possessed Empress
|image = E 573.png
|appearance = [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Temptation's Symphony]]<br>[[Temptation's Rhapsody]]
|money drop = 2,500¢ - 9,875¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a slow attack rate and less than a million health, but a whopping 10 knockbacks and an extremely tough 1.2m HP [[Shield]] that fully regenerates every time. And with her high damage, extreme range, [[Mini-Wave]]s and guaranteed 4-second slow, getting [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] to hit her may be easier said than done. You'll have to rely on units that can survive her attacks for a reasonable amount of time or something that's fragile but gets even in only a moment's notice, such as [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kai μ]].

