==Trivia==
*If the first seven [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]] are the Seven Deadly Sins, then Possessed Empress may represent Eve and the original sin, as her stages' maps are named [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Temptation's Symphony]] and [[Temptation's Rhapsody]]. [[Symphony of Bankruptcy (Merciless)|Symphony of Bankruptcy]] contains [[Sinner Snache]], a demonic snake, possibly representing the serpent that tempted Eve.
**She may also be a reference to Pandora and her box from Greek mythology, as her description involves opening a cursed artifact and unleashing evil, similarly to Pandora.
*Her cursed grimoire can also be seen in [[The Aku Realms]], on the "[[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]] Appears!" button.
*She has the slowest attack rate of all [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku Enemies]].
*Along with [[Nuclear Dragon King Berius (PC Enemy)|Nuclear Dragon King Berius]], [[Revolutionary Nobunaga]] and [[Ensanglion the Calamity]], she is one of the four non-collab enemies to be a counterpart of a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]].
*When including Shield health and regenerations, she has the highest total HP of all [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies, at a whopping 12,980,000 HP.

